Package: mlabs
Type: Package
Title: Multivariate Lévy Adaptive B-Spline Regression
Version: 1.0.0
Author: Sewon Park
Maintainer: Sewon Park <swpark0413@sookmyung.ac.kr>
Description: Bayesian nonparametric regression using a random sum of
    low-order tensor-product B-spline basis functions under a finite Lévy
    random measure prior. Posterior computation uses Bayesian backfitting,
    collapsed reversible-jump Markov chain Monte Carlo, and residual-guided
    structural proposals. Includes prediction, posterior summaries,
    predictor-use measures, and diagnostic plots.
License: GPL (>= 2)
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports: Rcpp (>= 1.0.0), stats, utils, grDevices
Suggests: ggplot2 (>= 3.4.0), patchwork, scales
LinkingTo: Rcpp, RcppArmadillo
Encoding: UTF-8
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
